[{"title":"少连笏","author":"洪亮吉","text":"秀实笏，击贼臣。\n少连笏，击奸臣。\n奸臣击纵不得死，不可谓非伟男子。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35967,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁塔名","author":"洪亮吉","text":"大雁塔，小雁塔，进士题名何杂沓。\n李白杜甫盖代才，可向塔上题名来？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35968,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"呼陆九","author":"洪亮吉","text":"唐宰相资格可弗论，翰林学士须得人。\n君不见，九重待若师举友，天子并闻呼陆九。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35969,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十六子","author":"洪亮吉","text":"八关十六子，党祸自此始。\n孤寒八百泪并流，此时毕竟思崖州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35970,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中兴相","author":"洪亮吉","text":"中兴宰相谁最优？\n唐惟李文饶，汉则魏弱侯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35971,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甘露变","author":"洪亮吉","text":"用李训，用郑注，赤族祸，兆甘露。\n君不见，当时宰臣最尸素，莫更追吟牡丹赋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35972,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仙韶院","author":"洪亮吉","text":"饭何所，木兰院。\n钱何所，仙韶院。\n一家将相三十年，少赖伊蒲餐，老给优伶钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35973,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"好羸马","author":"洪亮吉","text":"宁就荫，不试文。\n好羸马，不入群。\n会昌一品集，三唐进士皆不及。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35974,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五色云","author":"洪亮吉","text":"文章好，门阀好。\n天瑞五色云，人瑞郑仁表。\n君家一事笑煞人，歇后郑五为相臣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35975,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中朝党","author":"洪亮吉","text":"河北贼，易易耳，中朝朋党哄不止。\n党人祸结唐已亡，绝不关黄巢，亦不关朱梁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35976,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳长官","author":"洪亮吉","text":"届一州，寿天子，柳泌公然为刺史。\n君不见，丹方莫笑柳长官，郑注药要人心肝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35977,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孔吏部","author":"洪亮吉","text":"孔吏部，不乐居朝当有故。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35978,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纥干雀","author":"洪亮吉","text":"离函秦，入京洛，纥干山雀何不乐？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35979,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"投浊流","author":"洪亮吉","text":"唐家党祸今始休，清流均已投浊流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35980,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"花林坊","author":"洪亮吉","text":"生何所，花树乡。\n死何所，花林坊。\n君不见，韦平章，诗名可继韩致光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35981,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"马争栈","author":"洪亮吉","text":"二羊五马，扰及天下。\n马争栈，羊脱缰。\n羊已屠，马亦亡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35982,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"唐天子","author":"洪亮吉","text":"夜郎自大竟如此，洛州刺史唐天子。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35983,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"前进士","author":"洪亮吉","text":"侍中多，节使多。\n君不见，头街何似梁高士，前进士名堪没世。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35984,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"罗秀才","author":"洪亮吉","text":"沈校书，杜主客，可怜唐进士，连翩尽臣贼。\n君不见，罗家秀才未脱白，请兵诛梁一何力。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35985,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"修降表","author":"洪亮吉","text":"一隅蜀，何草草，五十年中两西讨。\n君不见，文臣不合似李昊，生世偏工作降表。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35986,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杀高郁","author":"洪亮吉","text":"唐天子，何太酷，一语居然杀高郁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35987,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"耿先生","author":"洪亮吉","text":"前朝天子方服丹，后宫太后飞入山。\n飞入山，从道士。\n如何耿先生，亦复善生子。\n君不见，长身玉貌殊可怜，卖药市上求青钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35988,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杀潘福","author":"洪亮吉","text":"金陵城，宁作潘佑死，不作张洎生。\n君不见，悔杀此人方出齿，明日牵机药随至。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35989,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十国纪","author":"洪亮吉","text":"典午十六国，大半起西北。\n唐余十国帝复王，十九皆起东南方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35990,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"依样画","author":"洪亮吉","text":"陶学士，佐命功。\n禅稿文，出袖中。\n朱梁周郭皆禅让，君画葫芦亦依样。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35991,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"豹留皮","author":"洪亮吉","text":"人留名，豹留皮。\n岂特王太师，兼有王凝妻。\n男能断头女断臂，千载英英有生气。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35992,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长乐老","author":"洪亮吉","text":"五代十数君，无一臻寿考。\n九朝历事只一人，死同宣圣年，生作长乐老。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35993,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"王官谷","author":"洪亮吉","text":"蹂函秦，躏京洛，贼不敢入王官谷。\n诗人一例悲沧桑，司空表圣韩致光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35994,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"降王长","author":"洪亮吉","text":"唐李煜，蜀孟昶。\n可惜覆国迟，不作降王长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35995,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泪洗面","author":"洪亮吉","text":"朝辞秦淮暮入汴，此间旦夕泪洗面。\n泪洗面，何时干，不若叔实无心肝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35996,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铸错字","author":"洪亮吉","text":"虽去逼，已失势，四十三县铁，难铸一错字。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35997,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读典坟","author":"洪亮吉","text":"生明时，读《典》《坟》，不然咏作何等人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35998,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"致太平","author":"洪亮吉","text":"半部《论语》王业成，一篇《周礼》致太平，宋朝儒术何峥嵘。\n君不见，学究来，宋阼开，语录布，倾宋阼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":35999,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"不晓天","author":"洪亮吉","text":"祥符中，宰相好。\n歌柘枝，辄醉倒。\n戴花吃酒须年少，不见宋家天不晓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36000,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"女尧舜","author":"洪亮吉","text":"青苗除，免役除，女中尧舜谁得如。\n君不见，内朝亦建宣仁号，仁政仁心法仁庙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36001,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"求发白","author":"洪亮吉","text":"染髭须，染鬓发，染黑作白求宰执，染白作黑媚侧室。\n君不见，今人古人何太远，宁作寇准无陆展。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36002,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杨无敌","author":"洪亮吉","text":"李无双，杨无敌，两名将，光简策。\n君不见，一既值卫青，一复逢王诜。\n陈家谷，遂杀身，数奇亦似飞将军。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36003,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"得状元","author":"洪亮吉","text":"得状元，由手搏。\n状元由手搏，尚胜种秘阁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36004,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"尚书令","author":"洪亮吉","text":"尚书令，中书令，一张元，执国柄。\n西师十万趋延安，此时空说有范韩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36005,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"艮岳成","author":"洪亮吉","text":"艮岳成，大有益，北师攻城多炮石。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36006,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"误后世","author":"洪亮吉","text":"不可作，平章事，尤不可，作学士。\n君不见，新法行，害一世；新经行，害百世。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36007,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"党人碑","author":"洪亮吉","text":"碑磷磷，列党人。\n碑首有君实，碑尾无安民。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36008,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"城门开","author":"洪亮吉","text":"言路开，城门塞，城门不塞言路塞。\n靖康内禅亦可哀，城门言路已并开，二帝北狩何时回？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36009,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬青树","author":"洪亮吉","text":"花石网，北宋亡。\n冬青一树，毕宋南渡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36010,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"妇长舌","author":"洪亮吉","text":"臣粘罕，臣兀术，夫长脚，妇长舌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36011,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曲端旗","author":"洪亮吉","text":"十万师，败符离。\n毕竟元帅符，不如曲端旗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36012,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和议成","author":"洪亮吉","text":"和议成，兵革偃，清凉居士时策蹇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36013,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梨花枪","author":"洪亮吉","text":"梨花枪，扰淮北。\n可怜二十年，夫妇迭作贼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36014,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"打六更","author":"洪亮吉","text":"五更虽转六，国祚不可续。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36015,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岳家军","author":"洪亮吉","text":"宁撼山，撼山易，撼岳家军难。\n岳家军，易易耳，除大将，只小纸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36016,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贾平章","author":"洪亮吉","text":"贾平章，木棉庵，何如半闲堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36017,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"放白鸽","author":"洪亮吉","text":"放白鸽，放白鸽，引得白雁来，宫中尽臣妾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36018,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郑所南","author":"洪亮吉","text":"画树不画根，画兰不画土。\n谁说郑所南，不及王炎午。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36019,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"斗蟋蟀","author":"洪亮吉","text":"荆襄一带胜败轻，正斗蟋蟀争输赢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36020,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"韩林儿","author":"严遂成","text":"韩林儿，或云李氏子，弥勒佛生山童死。\n黑牛白马巾红巾，青巾香巾随后尘。\n徽宗八世国号宋，正朔家家奉龙凤。\n瓜步舟覆儿可怜，明年始称吴元年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36021,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"陈友谅","author":"严遂成","text":"渔家子，起沔阳，夥颐沉沉称汉王。\n橹箱连锁棚走马，乘潮东向吞天下。\n奈何雁汊烧羊反间行，坏汝万里之长城。\n铁挝击碎寿辉首，义帝沉江战且走。\n饿鸮一声摩天风，目睛突出箭血红。\n相士贵墓术不验，沙岸雨立朝班空。\n虎斗龙争几朝暮，若翁业渔尚如故。\n不识门前拥彗迎，不逢俎上分羹怒。\n呜呼载尸安用镂金床，比之溺器七宝装，龙凤鞍帕真珠光。\n刘鋹孟昶汰已甚，与乱同事罔不亡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36022,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张士诚","author":"严遂成","text":"掺舟运盐张九四，白驹亭场树贼帜。\n万户告身拒不受，栋射三矢承天寺。\n吴趋踞坐拓土宽，遂与元绝称天完。\n诸将偃蹇载乐器，樗蒲蹴鞠军中欢。\n一炮飞空碎城堞，耳聩风谣黄蔡叶。\n锦衣银铠十条龙，万里桥边丧舟楫。\n呜呼以身死国真英雄，江东不降宋钱俶，河西不归汉窦融。\n妻刘亦挟丈夫气，齐云楼火通天红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36023,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"开平王常遇春","author":"严遂成","text":"常十万，东擒吴，西殪汉，北走庚申无用战。\n君不见采石矶，奋戈跳荡船如飞。\n又不见洛水槊，溃围驰突全身归。\n呜呼勇力绝伦年四十，凌烟鄂公好颜色。\n如何甲盾梦神人，疑汝饥来特就食。\n英雄憔悴卧田间，日月之明有时蚀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36024,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"歧阳王李文忠","author":"严遂成","text":"歧阳王酷似其舅，事事直与古人偶。\n君不见吴吕蒙，法立诛必凶门凶，一笠一釜将毋同。\n又不见汉耿弇，疏勒飞泉凿深险。\n乘马蹋地刑以牲，桑哥儿麻军破胆。\n临阵踔厉驰风樯，遇大敌勇不可当。\n家居蝉蜕憺无事，忘其亲贵身为王。\n雅歌投壶祭征虏，恂恂书生岳忠武。\n兵权一释学为儒，金华胡范吾所师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36025,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李景隆","author":"严遂成","text":"五十万人付年少，是谓弃兵而揖盗。\n怏怏宿将丈人行，踞坐膝行礼何傲。\n玺书黄钺渡江来，船沉风雨波涛堆。\n大旗一折车小动，委弃如山空壁送。\n召还惊定剩游魂，僇逃庙社天家恩。\n殿前丛殴幸不死，死则谁启金川门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36026,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东瓯王汤和","author":"严遂成","text":"此城据之屋脊坐，铁券时时书酒过。\n部勒群儿夙负奇，容棺之墟无稳卧。\n忽然治第中都中，安车迎入朝元宫。\n里闬兵兴叙旧事，御膳法酒时相从。\n是时元臣率丽法，若胡为者封瓯东。\n妾媵资遣日卧疾，失音之老其途穷。\n乃知韩彭菹醢坐少壮，从赤松游庶无恙。\n不然吏事既以责三公，兵权不释酒杯中，安得人人寿以终。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36027,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郢国公冯国胜","author":"严遂成","text":"求珠纳哈出之妻，私匿驼马金山西。\n细故失意祸奄至，诸子不封竟不嗣。\n黑气满室非吉徵，春秋渐高渐猜贰。\n独不念龙盘虎踞金陵图，拔为根本帝王都。\n阿兄挽辂汉刘敬，可以论功赎罪无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36028,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东莞伯何真","author":"严遂成","text":"钞悬十千募擒贼，王成之奴缚主出。\n如数予钞赏不虚，随具汤镬烹于车。\n扬旗伐鼓吁尔众，奴叛主者罪深重。\n呜呼缣囊夜络彭宠头，裂地曾封不义侯。\n侯兮侯兮乃不义，起自贼中铜马帝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36029,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉风汉郭德成","author":"严遂成","text":"巩昌侯封予世券，骁骑舍人醉风汉。\n因缘女弟宁王妃，胡然剃发衣僧衣。\n百罂金币劳赐厚，侍宴后庭冠脱首。\n不事事乃无职守，时复中之饮醇酒。\n人生适意多得钱，唱佛不已祈神仙。\n后党祸起率连坐，此老闭门足高卧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36030,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吉安侯陆仲亨","author":"严遂成","text":"持一升麦草间伏，呼之曰来从逐鹿。\n此我临濠初起时，臣作股肱帝心腹。\n积功封侯命不轻，一掷家奴封帖木。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36031,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"诚意伯刘基","author":"严遂成","text":"西湖异云西北至，十年前识金陵气。\n陈强张富决雌雄，帷幄屏人其语秘。\n虬髯侍侧蹑胡床，如以真王易假王。\n跃起大呼徙别舸，难星一炮占鄱阳。\n公何有术不自救，谈洋茗洋吏讦奏。\n偾辕之驾挟医来，积中拳石吞乌咮。\n京房郭璞数莫逃，天文象纬书可烧。\n幸而遇时佐洪武，不然著郁离子究何补。\n异授有神亦有师，泯没平生邓祥甫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36032,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"韩国公李善长","author":"严遂成","text":"韩国公，萧何主守高于血汗功，谁连染之胡惟庸。\n惟庸弟之亲，可以赎其兄之身。\n何至杀及七十人，狱辞传著真不真。\n呜呼王虞部疏抗声读，一字一痛哭。\n开国元勋传，变为奸党录。\n人言汉高心肠薄，不闻并赤萧何族。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36033,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宋学士濂","author":"严遂成","text":"字呼景濂数燕见，坐命茶，侍命膳，往复咨询常夜半。\n温树之署无是非，具以实对心无机。\n手调甘露赐绮帛，藏此制作百岁衣。\n夫既欲其生，曷又欲其死，谪戍于夔不赦汝。\n白首万里身荷戈，识是当时醉学士。\n学士那复醉三觞，梦闻师父称太子。\n呜呼莲花山下秋风多，鬼些楚辞白马歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36034,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏州守魏观","author":"严遂成","text":"生不能王败而走，遗基岂复为鬼有。\n都水行司地合迁，青燐黑胜散如烟。\n浚锦帆泾规水利，利民之外无他意。\n以此受谮僇其身，巷以哭者苏州民。\n哭太守，太守生，礼行乡饮酒。\n太守死，谁与订经史。\n课绩空为天下先，悔而归葬骨已沦重渊。\n不如前人事苛刻，全受全归陈烙铁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36035,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"刘学士三吾","author":"严遂成","text":"春夏榜，南北榜。\n南有私，北无党。\n空持朝鲜玳瑁笔，等之敝帚千金享。\n然而六十一人中，讵皆有文在其掌。\n琮也善易不善著，翰苑当阨知不知。\n八十老者戍边死，坐右燕王左太子。\n早知天命有所归，金陵城上燕南飞。\n不如当时不力陈，无用丧师五十万，十族九族免涂碳。\n周公成王本一家，事犹贤于新莽篡。\n靖难功，谁酿成之坦坦翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36036,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"危学士素","author":"严遂成","text":"司马迁生蔡邕死，关系存亡一代史。\n有元实录录未曾，后妃传事逸无徵，幸向宫监馈饧饵。\n挽起井中僧大梓，史不可死身不死。\n小车赐宴诗后成，先忧之意答圣明，忽然东阁闻履声。\n亡臣佐命满君侧，岂必人人文相国。\n无城守功作余阙，安得和州享庙食。\n呜呼责尔一死尔亦能，只恐真珈饮器没西僧，万古空图永穆陵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36037,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]